! lobsterin for NaCl, matched to NaCl/wannier90.win
! Wannier projections:  Na:s,p   Cl:p   (7 functions per cell)
! Wannier outer window: -5 to 18 eV absolute, E_F = -0.6989 eV (OUTCAR)
!   -> -4.30 to 18.70 eV relative to E_F (LOBSTER energies are relative to E_F)
!   This keeps the Cl 3p valence bands and drops Na 2p (-21.8 eV) and Cl 3s (-13.3 eV).
basisSet pbeVaspFit2015
basisfunctions Na 3s 3pq
basisfunctions Cl 3p
COHPstartEnergy -4.30
COHPendEnergy 18.70
cohpGenerator from 1.4 to 20
